Scope

This license covers the multi-tag additions in this repository (the
multi-tag changes in patch/wrf-wvt-multitag.patch, install.sh, tools/ and
tests/). It does not cover WRF or WRF-WVTs:

  - WRF (https://github.com/wrf-model/WRF) is distributed under its own terms
    by NCAR and the WRF developers.
  - WRF-WVTs (https://github.com/damianinsua/WRF-WVTs), the moisture-tracer
    code by Damian Insua-Costa and Gonzalo Miguez-Macho, belongs to its
    authors. The patch contains unchanged lines of WRF and WRF-WVTs code only
    as context for applying the changes; that code is not relicensed here.
